{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1794","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A. Prefix and Suffix Array"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Marcos loves strings a lot, so he has a favorite string $$$s$$$ consisting of lowercase English letters. For this string, he wrote down all its non-empty prefixes and suffixes (except for $$$s$$$) on a piece of paper in arbitrary order. You see all these strings and wonder if Marcos' favorite string is a palindrome or not. So, your task is to decide whether $$$s$$$ is a palindrome by just looking at the piece of paper."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A string $$$a$$$ is a prefix of a string $$$b$$$ if $$$a$$$ can be obtained from $$$b$$$ by deletion of several (possibly, zero or all) characters from the end."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A string $$$a$$$ is a suffix of a string $$$b$$$ if $$$a$$$ can be obtained from $$$b$$$ by deletion of several (possibly, zero or all) characters from the beginning."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A palindrome is a string that reads the same backward as forward, for example, strings \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"gg"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"ioi"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"abba"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"icpci"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" are palindromes, but strings \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"codeforces"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"abcd"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"alt"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" are not."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each test consists of multiple test cases. The first line contains a single integer $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\le t \\le 120$$$) — the number of test cases. The description of test cases follows."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of each test case contains a single integer $$$n$$$ ($$$2\\le n \\le 20$$$) — the length of the string $$$s$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line of each test case contains $$$2n-2$$$ strings $$$a_1, a_2, \\cdots, a_{2n-2}$$$ — all non-empty prefixes and suffixes of $$$s$$$, not including itself, in arbitrary order."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that these strings are all the non-empty prefixes and suffixes of some string consisting of lowercase English letters."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each test case, output \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"YES"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" if $$$s$$$ is a palindrome, and \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"NO"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" otherwise."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You can output the answer in any case (upper or lower). For example, the strings \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"yEs"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"yes"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Yes"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", and \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"YES"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" will be recognized as positive responses."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n5\n4\nbcd cd a d abc ab\n3\ni io i oi\n2\ng g\n3\nt al lt a\n4\nbba a ab a abb ba\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\nNO\nYES\nYES\nNO\nYES\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first test case, $$$s$$$ is \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"abcd"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\". Its prefixes are \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"a"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"ab"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" and \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"abc"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", and its suffixes are \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"d"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"cd"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" and \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"bcd"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\". As the string \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"abcd"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" is not a palindrome, the answer is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"NO"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second test case, $$$s$$$ is \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"ioi"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\". Its prefixes are \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"i"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" and \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"io"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", and its suffixes are \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"i"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" and \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"oi"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\". As the string \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"ioi"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" is a palindrome, the answer is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"YES"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the third test case, $$$s$$$ is \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"gg"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" which is a palindrome."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the fourth test case, $$$s$$$ is \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"alt"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" which is not a palindrome."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"A","problemCode":"1794A","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1794/problem/A"}